e too. Take every allegation seriously but no one ever said \u201dtrust all women\u201d gtfoh","media":null,"username":"Sigmundine2","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":11.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":2,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":17,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":10.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1256593062966562816","date":1588430107000,"rawContent":"@1amRosario @SistahScholar @morningmika @chrislhayes @TheBeatWithAri Do you not think women are people? Do you think women cannot lie and be sociopaths? It\u2019s never been, \u201cBelieve All Women.\u201d #metoo is about taking women\u2019s credible accusations seriously and investigating impartially.","media":null,"username":"Sigmundine2","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":12.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":2,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":18,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":11.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1256609237800714240","date":1588433963000,"rawContent":"Why should I believe all women? What kind of crock \u2018o shit is that? Listen to women, investigate their claims, give them due process. Don\u2019t allow bad faith actors to pervert #MeToo into mindless BELEEEEEEVE ALL WOMEN!","media":null,"username":"Sigmundine2","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":13.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":2,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":19,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":12.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1258827117632126976","date":1588962747000,"rawContent":"@rowdyh1 @mitchellscomet I didn\u201